---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro"
---

<Layout title="FX Console - ローマ字対応" description="After EffectsのFX Consoleでエフェクトをローマ字検索できるようにする設定ファイル">
  <article class="container">
    <header class="hero">
      <img
        src="/booth-fxconsole.jpg"
        alt="FX Console ローマ字対応"
        class="hero-image"
        style="view-transition-name: booth-image-fx-console"
      />
    </header>

    <div class="content-wrap">
      <div class="meta">
        <span class="badge">BOOTH</span>
        <span class="tag">After Effects</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="title">FX Console - ローマ字対応</h1>

      <p class="lead">
        FX Console でエフェクトをローマ字で検索できるようになります
      </p>

      <div class="booth-cta-wrap">
        <a
          href="https://booth.pm/ja/items/6176975"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="booth-cta"
        >
          BOOTH で入手 →
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="video-wrap">
        <iframe
          src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/SUEyuTJa2_I"
          title="FX Console ローマ字対応 デモ"
          allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
          allowfullscreen
        ></iframe>
      </div>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>使用方法</h2>
        <p>DL した <code>.fxs</code> を FX Console の Import からインポートしてください</p>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>動作環境</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>FX Console v1.0.5</li>
          <li>Adobe After Effects 2024 以下</li>
          <li>言語設定：日本語</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>検証環境</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Windows 11</li>
          <li>Adobe After Effects 2024（言語設定：日本語）</li>
          <li>FX Console v1.0.5</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="specs">
          <span>Ryzen9 5950X</span>
          <span>RTX 4070Ti 12GB</span>
          <span>DDR4 64GB</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>アップデート履歴</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>2024-10-11: v0.1</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>お問い合わせ</h2>
        <p>
          「検索でエフェクトがヒットしない！」等は<br />
          <a href="mailto:rotoworks.contact+booth@gmail.com">rotoworks.contact+booth@gmail.com</a>
          までお問い合わせください
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <nav class="back-nav">
      <a href="/works">← Back to Works</a>
    </nav>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero {
    margin-top: 40px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: var(--color-bg-subtle);
  }

  .hero-image {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .content-wrap {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 48px auto 0;
  }

  .meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .badge {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-accent);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .tag {
    font-size: 11px;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background-color: var(--color-bg-subtle);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .title {
    font-size: clamp(24px, 4vw, 36px);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .booth-cta-wrap {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .booth-cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-accent);
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .booth-cta:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-white);
  }

  .video-wrap {
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: var(--color-dark);
  }

  .video-wrap iframe {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    border: none;
    display: block;
  }

  .section {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .section h2 {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .section p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .section code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    background-color: var(--color-bg-subtle);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .section ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .section li {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    padding: 4px 0;
    padding-left: 16px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .section li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 12px;
    width: 5px;
    height: 5px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--color-border);
  }

  .section a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .specs {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  .specs span {
    font-size: 12px;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    background-color: var(--color-bg-subtle);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .back-nav {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 64px auto 0;
    padding-top: 32px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .back-nav a {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .back-nav a:hover {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
</style>
